#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &infocenter; (from now on referred to simply as <quote>the information "
"center</quote>) provides you with a centralized and convenient overview of "
"your system and desktop environment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The information center is made up of multiple modules. Each module is a "
"separate application, but the information center organizes all of these "
"programs into a convenient location."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This next section details the use of the information center itself. For "
"information on individual modules, please see <link linkend=\"module\">Info "
"Center Modules</link>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting the &infocenter;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &infocenter; can be started 3 ways:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Applications </guimenu><guisubmenu>System</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Info Center</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"application launcher in the panel."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>. "
"This will bring up &krunner;. Type <userinput><command>kinfocenter</"
"command></userinput>, and press &Enter;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can type <command>kinfocenter &amp;</command> at any command prompt."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "All three of these methods are equivalent, and produce the same result."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The &infocenter; Screen</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start the information center, you are presented with a window, "
"which can be divided into 3 functional parts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &infocenter; Screen."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The &infocenter; Screen</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Across the top is a toolbar. The toolbar will provide you with quick access "
"to most of &infocenter;'s features like export, get help on the current "
"module and a help menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Along the left hand side, is a column with a filter field at the top. This "
"is a where you choose which module to investigate. You can learn how to "
"navigate through the modules in the section called <link linkend=\"module-"
"intro\">Navigating Modules</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main panel shows you the system information about the selected module."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &infocenter; Toolbar"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This next section gives you a brief description of what each toolbar item "
"does."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Export</guimenu> button"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The export button allows you to export information from the current "
"information module if the module allows this functionality. Clicking the "
"export button will bring up a file dialog that will allow you to choose the "
"location of the file"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Module help</guimenu> button"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This button opens khelpcenter with the current help page for the information "
"module."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Help</guimenu> Menu button"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: sect2
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exiting The &kde; Information Centre"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can exit the info centre one of three ways:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> on the "
"keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guiicon>Close</guiicon> button on the frame surrounding the "
"info centre."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &infocenter; Modules"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "Navigating Modules"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a list of the <emphasis>standard</emphasis> configuration modules "
"provided by the <application role=\"package\">&kde; base</application> "
"package. Please note that there may be many more modules on your system if "
"you have installed additional software."
msgstr ""

